### Get my profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: {{token}}

### [KO] GET /users/me sans token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me

### Get my unavailabilities
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/unavailabilities
Authorization: {{token}}

### [KO] GET /users/me/unavailabilities sans token
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/unavailabilities

### Add an unavailability
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/unavailabilities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "startDate": "2026-03-10",
  "endDate": "2026-03-15"
}

### Try to add an unavailability without token (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/unavailabilities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2026-03-10",
  "endDate": "2026-03-15"
}

### [OK 200] PATCH /users/me/speciality — spécialité valide
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/speciality
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "specialityName": "Executeur"
}

### [KO] PATCH /users/me/speciality sans token
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/speciality
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "specialityName": "Executeur"
}

### [KO] PATCH /users/me/speciality — spécialité inconnue
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/speciality
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "specialityName": "SpecialiteInexistante"
}

### [OK 200] PATCH /users/me/profile-picture — URL valide (depuis la liste /profile-pictures)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile-picture
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "profilePictureUrl": "https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/bottts/svg?seed=banana"
}

### [KO] PATCH /users/me/profile-picture sans token
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile-picture
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profilePictureUrl": "https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/bottts/svg?seed=banana"
}

### [KO] PATCH /users/me/profile-picture — URL inconnue
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile-picture
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "profilePictureUrl": "https://url-inconnue.com/image.svg"
}

### Update password
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "zahratest",
  "newPassword": "zahrateste"
}

### Try to update password with wrong old password (should fail)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/me/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "oldPassword": "wrongpassword",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### Get all users (public, no token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Get all users (with token, should also work)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get user by id (public, no token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Get user by id (with token, should also work)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get user by id not found (should fail 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/99999

### [OK 204] PATCH /users/{id}/ban — admin banne un utilisateur (remplacer {id} par un ID réel non-admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2/ban
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### [KO 401] PATCH /users/{id}/ban sans token
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2/ban

### [KO 403] PATCH /users/{id}/ban — utilisateur non-admin
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/2/ban
Authorization: {{token}}

### [KO 404] PATCH /users/{id}/ban — utilisateur inexistant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/99999/ban
Authorization: {{adminToken}}